# jtt config calendar: see docs/commands/config-calendar.md.
Output docs/commands/gifs/config-calendar.gif
Set Height 640
Set Width 1280
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape

Type "jtt config calendar --hours-per-day 7.5" Sleep 500ms Enter Sleep 1500ms
Type "jtt calculate -p OPS --from 2026-09-21 --to 2026-09-28 --as days" Sleep 500ms Enter Sleep 6000ms
